    "每 30 秒检查一次出口 IP，在 Surge 等工具里切换节点就会被发现。「自动改」只在当前定位来自「跟随代理出口」时生效，不会覆盖你手动选的城市。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Checks the exit IP every 30 seconds, so switching servers in tools like Surge gets noticed. Auto Move only applies when the current location came from Follow Proxy Exit, and never overrides a city you picked yourself."
          }
        },
